# Force LF on checkout for every platform.
#
# Claude Code parses YAML frontmatter in commands/, agents/ and skills/ and will
# not accept a `---\r\n` delimiter. On Windows, git's default core.autocrlf=true
# converts LF to CRLF at checkout, which silently breaks every command and agent
# in this plugin: the files are present and look correct, the plugin reports as
# enabled, and no commands register.
#
# This file is what prevents that. Do not remove it.
* text=auto eol=lf
